  "details": "Build 1515 introduced disabled action buttons\n\n> Both the \"Request Invite/Join\" and \"Send Invite\" buttons in the user details menus will now be disabled instead of disappearing and causing other buttons to shift.\n\nThis would make well-trained users' muscle memory happy but may also confuse people who are not familiar with the system's behavior.\n\nSo, I suggest showing a tooltip on disabled action buttons and guiding why it is disabled.",
